Ubertooth One (Bluetooth Security Tool)
Open-source Bluetooth monitoring and analysis device.
Used to study Bluetooth traffic and security weaknesses.
Supports research into pairing, encryption, and wireless protocols.
⚠️ Only analyze Bluetooth devices you are permitted to test.

RFID Hacking Kit / Card Cloning Research
Tools used to read or emulate RFID/NFC card signals.
Demonstrates risks in contactless cards and access badges.
Helps organizations strengthen authentication systems.
⚠️ Cloning cards without authorization is a criminal offense.
